AI Work in FS GCCs – Goldman Sachs, JPMC, Nomura
1. Overall Industry Pattern (GCCs in Banking)
AI adoption across financial services GCCs follows a phased approach:
Technology (High maturity):
AI-led SDLC – coding, testing, DevOps automation
Operations (Moderate maturity):
MIS, reporting, KYC, document/email processing
Core workflows (Low maturity):
Payments, settlements, post-trade (high regulatory risk)
Key constraints: compliance risk, legacy systems, data quality, auditability.
